  "description": "ToolUp.Tabular — typed CSV / XLSX ingestion for ToolUp.Platform consumers. Parses tabular files into typed rows against a declared column schema and returns a structured per-row / per-cell error report (row index, column, expected, actual, constraint violated) instead of throwing on first error. CSV leg is zero-dependency BCL RFC 4180; XLSX leg reads via DocumentFormat.OpenXml. Streaming row enumeration keeps large files out of memory.",
